        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "hei-fan-stock-and-recipes",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Reading Hei Fan’s inheritance, Fang Yuan finds immortal killer moves built on immortal level year Gu as their core, among them bountiful year, which raises how fast every resource in the immortal aperture is produced for a year after activation. A matched set of four moves uses the same core to slow or speed the aperture’s internal time. Assessing his own year Gu against bountiful year’s cost, Fang Yuan judges it only a little over the hundred year level and decides he must parallel refine it further before he can use the move.",
        "chapters": [
          1130
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "hei-fan-stock-and-recipes",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Hei Fan’s true inheritance includes five parallel refinement Immortal Gu recipes that elevate immortal level year Gu. The method he used most adds large numbers of mortal year Gu into the immortal level year Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1131
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "hei-fan-stock-and-recipes",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_recipe"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan later notes that year Gu has fallen in terms of years and that he needs to parallel refine it again.",
        "chapters": [
          1179
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "years-parallel-refinement",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
