          "inh_hei_fan_true_inheritance",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "path_time",
          "char_hei_fan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The bountiful year Fang Yuan activates over dragon scale sea area is a modified version of the move, which keeps year Gu as its core and adds rank seven Perseverance Immortal Gu as its first supplementary Gu worm.",
